OL,3,CSeveral athletes 'unaccounted for'
OL,4,Cafter Commonwealth Games in Glasgow
OL,6,FSeveral athletes are "unaccounted for"
OL,7,Fafter the Glasgow 2026 Commonwealth
OL,8,FGames, according to Police Scotland.
OL,10,FThe Ugandan sporting news website NBS
OL,11,FSport said that four members of
OL,12,FUganda's boxing team have reportedly
OL,13,Fgone missing in Scotland.
OL,15,FThey said the athletes did not rejoin
OL,16,Fthe rest of the delegation before the
OL,17,Fteam's scheduled return to Uganda on
OL,18,FTuesday.
