OL,3,CSeveral athletes 'unaccounted for'
OL,4,Cafter Commonwealth Games in Glasgow
OL,6,FPolice Scotland told ITV News: "Police
OL,7,FScotland has received reports of
OL,8,Fseveral athletes who are unaccounted
OL,9,Ffor.
OL,11,F"Inquiries are ongoing to assess the
OL,12,Fcircumstances, and early engagement is
OL,13,Ftaking place with the Home Office."
OL,15,FCommonwealth Games chief executive
OL,16,FPhil Batty said on Monday: "We've
OL,17,Fwelcomed nearly 3,000 athletes to the
OL,18,Fcity from 74 nations.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
