OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1786191514
OL,3,CSeveral athletes 'unaccounted for'
OL,4,Cafter Commonwealth Games in Glasgow
OL,6,F"We want to deliver a safe and secure
OL,7,Fgames, so we work really closely with
OL,8,FPolice Scotland, the Border Force, and
OL,9,FUK visas and immigration to make sure
OL,10,Feveryone arrives and departs in line
OL,11,Fwith regulation."
OL,13,FThe Ugandan ministry of education and
OL,14,Fsports has been contacted for comment.
OL,16,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,17,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,18,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,19,Finbox every Friday morning.
