OL,3,CSeveral athletes 'unaccounted for'
OL,4,Cafter Commonwealth Games in Glasgow
OL,6,FITV News understands that the Home
OL,7,FOffice will take action accordingly if
OL,8,Fit is made aware of any breaches of
OL,9,Fimmigration law, and that it takes all
OL,10,Fnecessary steps to prevent people who
OL,11,Fcould abuse the immigration system
OL,12,Ffrom entering the UK.
OL,14,FThe Home Office maintains a policy of
OL,15,Fnot routinely commenting on individual
OL,16,Fasylum cases, with claims considered
OL,17,Fon their individual merits in
OL,18,Faccordance with the UK's international
OL,19,Fobligations.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
