OL,3,CSeveral athletes 'unaccounted for'
OL,4,Cafter Commonwealth Games in Glasgow
OL,6,FPakistan Today also reported that a
OL,7,Fboxer had not boarded a flight with
OL,8,Fteam mates back to Pakistan.
OL,10,FAccording to local media, the athlete
OL,11,Fwas last seen in his hotel room at
OL,12,Fabout 2am when the team where
OL,13,Fscheduled to meet at 9am to leave.
OL,15,FThe Commonwealth Games finished on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,18,FSimilar incidences have happened
OL,19,Ffollowing previous Commonwealth Games.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
