OL,3,CSeveral athletes 'unaccounted for'
OL,4,Cafter Commonwealth Games in Glasgow
OL,6,FIn 2014, two Ugandan rugby players
OL,7,FBenon Kizza and Philip Pariyo
OL,8,Fdisappeared and were found playing the
OL,9,Fsport for an amateur club in Wales.
OL,10,FThey later claimed asylum.
OL,12,FMeanwhile, in 2018, around 50
OL,13,Fcompetitors stayed in Australia
OL,14,Fillegally while several more applied
OL,15,Ffor refugee status.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/6
